       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. rna-transcription.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-COMPLEMENT PIC X(64).
       01 I PIC 99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       RNA-TRANSCRIPTION.
       PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 64
         EVALUATE WS-COMPLEMENT(I:1)
            WHEN 'C' MOVE 'G' TO WS-COMPLEMENT(I:1)
            WHEN 'G' MOVE 'C' TO WS-COMPLEMENT(I:1)
            WHEN 'A' MOVE 'U' TO WS-COMPLEMENT(I:1)
            WHEN 'T' MOVE 'A' TO WS-COMPLEMENT(I:1)
         END-EVALUATE
       END-PERFORM
       CONTINUE.
